      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/appcompat#1.0.0",
      "html": "<p><strong>New features</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/androidx/appcompat/graphics/drawable/AnimatedStateListDrawableCompat\"><code>AnimatedStateListDrawableCompat</code></a> provides animated transitions between drawable states.</li>\n</ul>",
      "commits": null
    },
    {
      "group": "appcompat",
      "id": "appcompat",
      "name": "Appcompat",
      "version": "1.0.2",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/appcompat#1.0.2",
      "html": "<p>Bugfix release of <code>core-1.0.1</code> and <code>appcompat-1.0.2</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Bug fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Fixed bug where <code>PrecomputedTextCompat</code> would crash when used with RTL <code>AppCompatTextView</code>. <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/113070424\">b/113070424</a></li>\n</ul>",
      "commits": null
    },
    {
