      "name": "Core and Core-ktx",
      "version": "1.0.1",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/core#1.0.1",
      "html": "<p>Bugfix release of <code>core-1.0.1</code> and <code>appcompat-1.0.2</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>Bug fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Fixed bug where <code>PrecomputedTextCompat</code> would crash when used with RTL <code>AppCompatTextView</code>. <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/113070424\">b/113070424</a></li>\n</ul>",
