      "version": "1.0.0",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/vectordrawable#1.0.0",
      "html": "<p><strong>New features</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li><a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/androidx/vectordrawable/graphics/drawable/VectorDrawableCompat\"><code>VectorDrawableCompat</code></a> gains support for gradient and <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/content/res/ColorStateList\"><code>ColorStateList</code></a> fills and strokes.</li>\n</ul>",
